  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Today&#x2019;s Speakers Bryan Schumaker EVP and &#11;Chief Financial Officer David Moezidis President &amp; Chief Executive Officer</font></p>
