  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Q2 2026 Guidance Q2-26E Net Sales $700M to $740M Gross Margin &#x2013; non-GAAP 10.4% to 10.6% Operating Margin &#x2013; non-GAAP 5.1% to 5.3% Interest and Other Expenses ~$3.5M Non-operating Expenses $0.8M to $1.2M Stock-Based Compensation ~$6.1M Effective Tax Rate 26% to 27% Diluted EPS &#x2013; GAAP $0.51 to $0.57 Diluted EPS &#x2013; non-GAAP $0.65 to $0.71 Weighted-Average Shares ~36.3M</font></p>
